@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 16: POST /api/v1/refunds/:id/comments (Comentar sin decidir)

actor "Aprobador / Vendedor" as User
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Workflow Service" as Service
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

User -> Web: Escribe un comentario en el detalle
Web -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds/2001/comments\n(CommentDto: { comment })
Gateway -> Service: addRefundComment(refundOrderId: 2001, payload, actor)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findRefundOrderWithInstance(2001)
OrdersDB --> Service: order { current_workflow_instance_id: 90 }

Service -> InstanceDB: 2. findInstance(90)
InstanceDB --> Service: instance { status: 'IN_APPROVAL', current_level_order: 2 }

Service -> Service: 3. assertCommentable(order, instance, actor, payload)
note right of Service
  422 si el comentario viene vacío
  409 si la nota no tiene instancia
  403 si el actor no participa de la nota
  (ni vendedor dueño ni rol de algún nivel)
  Comentar NO consume la firma del nivel ni
  cambia estados.
end note

Service -> ActionsDB: 4. insertWorkflowAction(90, currentLevelId, 'COMMENT')
note right of ActionsDB
  - comment del actor
  - previous_status = new_status (no hay
    movimiento de estado)
  - sin amount_before / amount_after
  'COMMENT' ya está en el CHECK de action.
  Y el CHECK de reason no lo alcanza: el
  motivo solo es obligatorio en REJECT,
  REACTIVATE y CANCEL.
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: ok

Service --> Gateway: 201 Created (CommentResult: { actionId, createdAt })
Gateway --> Web: 201 Created
Web --> User: El comentario aparece en el historial
@enduml
